  "description": "React front-end skin for NewLife.Cube (React 19 + Ant Design 6), with dynamic menus, metadata-driven lists and forms, CRUD, OAuth sign-in and runtime localization. 魔方 React 前端皮肤：动态菜单、字段元数据驱动的列表与表单、CRUD、OAuth 登录与运行时多语言本地化；引用 NuGet 包即可获得完整前端。",
